248
00:55:17,243 --> 00:55:18,063
tam olarak ne?

249
00:55:20,103 --> 00:55:20,483
Diğer.

250
00:55:22,283 --> 00:55:23,003
Şimdi

251
00:55:23,003 --> 00:55:25,323
diskriminatör model de ki

